 - **States:** Pending (waiting), Visible, Leaving (its host plays it out; gone when the host says so, or after 5 s if the host stopped ticking).
-- **Schedule** (per channel with something waiting): the host = the live hosts showing the channel, highest Host Priority (ties: the last registered). Held ones skipped (game paused for pausing types, cinematic mode, Hold / Freeze suppressions). Gap. Fill up to capacity (Leaving ones still count, so a one-at-a-time banner waits for the exit). Still full: preempt the lowest-priority one on screen below the waiting one's priority (shown Min Display Time; requeued or dismissed), else Make Room lets the oldest go.
